<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
Queue runner - macOS launchd configuration

INSTALLATION (recommended):
  cd dev-agents
  make queue-runner-install

This will:
  - Copy this plist to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
  - Load it with launchctl

After installation the runner ticks once a minute: if no dispatch is running
for a repo and the Ops Floor queue (logs/fleet-queue.json) holds a queued plan
for that repo whose blocked reason is empty, it starts that plan with
  ./scripts/dispatch.sh <repo-url> <plan> --detach --auto <flags>
reading the repo URL and the flags from the plan's own "# DISPATCH:" header
line. At most one start per tick, one running dispatch per repo. What it
started is written to logs/dispatch-runs/queue-runner.log in dev-agents.

Off by default: nothing runs until this file is installed. RunAtLoad is false
so installing it never starts a plan at that same moment; the first tick is
one minute later.

PAUSE (one variable, the runner does nothing while it is set):
  launchctl setenv QUEUE_RUNNER_PAUSE 1
  launchctl unsetenv QUEUE_RUNNER_PAUSE

The dispatch the runner starts is a session leader of its own (that is what
--detach does), so it survives the end of the tick. AbandonProcessGroup is set
as a second guard: launchd must not reap what the tick left behind.

The dev-agents checkout comes from DEV_AGENTS_ROOT, defaulting to the same
dev-projects/AI-Orchestration parent the PR Sentinel plist points at:
  launchctl setenv DEV_AGENTS_ROOT /path/to/dev-agents

USEFUL COMMANDS:
  make queue-runner-status
  make queue-runner-dry              (what the next tick would start)
  tail -f ~/Library/Logs/queue-runner.log
  make queue-runner-uninstall

Log file: ~/Library/Logs/queue-runner.log (the tick's own output; the runs it
starts log under logs/dispatch-runs/ in dev-agents)

-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.arlen.queue-runner</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/zsh</string>
        <string>-c</string>
        <string>cd "${DEV_AGENTS_ROOT:-/Users/arlenrios/Desktop/dev-projects/AI-Orchestration/dev-agents}" &amp;&amp; ./scripts/queue-runner.sh &gt;&gt; ~/Library/Logs/queue-runner.log 2&gt;&amp;1</string>
    </array>

    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>60</integer>   <!-- once a minute -->

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>

    <key>AbandonProcessGroup</key>
    <true/>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arlenrios/Library/Logs/queue-runner.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arlenrios/Library/Logs/queue-runner.log</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
